* [CRITICAL] LOGIC bus.emit("userCreated", user) (in createUser function)
  - Issue: The event name mismatch prevents the notifications/subscribers.js listeners for "user:created" from being triggered, so welcome emails and signup analytics are not sent, causing incorrect user onboarding behavior that callers rely on.
  - Fix: Change the emit back to bus.emit("user:created", user);
